     overlay + residual; the designed object + its figure-of-merit map). Cheap enough to run every time. -->
Images land in `results/images/`, prefixed by the experiment label for easy side-by-side browsing.

### Per-experiment data (light, always)
{{PER_EXP_ARTIFACTS}}
